OL,3,GNEWSANew traffic island leaves road too
OL,4,Anarrow for buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuses have been withdrawn from the
OL,7,Fmiddle of a village in Leicestershire
OL,8,Fafter a new pedestrian island left a
OL,9,Froad too narrow for them to get
OL,10,Fthrough.
OL,12,FThe island was installed in Rearsby
OL,13,FRoad, in Queniborough, as part of work
OL,14,Fto upgrade the junction which was
OL,15,Fcompleted on Saturday.
OL,17,FHowever, Arriva Midlands said the new
OL,18,Froad layout had not left enough space
OL,19,Ffor its buses to get past safely
OL,20,Fwithout mounting the pavement.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
