OL,3,GNEWSANew traffic island leaves road too
OL,4,Anarrow for buses
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council highways
OL,7,Fofficials said the work had been
OL,8,Fcarried out by contractors for
OL,9,Fdeveloper David Wilson Homes but the
OL,10,Fdesign had "not proved correct".
